OL,3,ABereaved families will not face tax
OL,4,Abill over pension delays under new
OL,5,Arules
OL,6,
OL,7,FBereaved families will no longer be hit
OL,8,Fby an unexpected tax bill because of
OL,9,Fsevere delays paying out civil service
OL,10,Fpensions, following a change in
OL,11,FWednesday's Budget.
OL,13,FUnder previous HMRC rules, certain lump
OL,14,Fsum pension payments had to be paid
OL,15,Fwithin two years of the pension scheme
OL,16,Fbeing notified of a death to remain
OL,17,Ftax-free.
OL,19,FCampaigners had warned some families
OL,20,Fcould face an unfair financial penalty
OL,21,Fbecause of delays which were not their
OL,22,Ffault.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
